    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>方案</>\n方案分为非凡方案与装备方案，非凡方案是角色技能、天赋、封印物组成的搭配，装备方案是角色装备、恩赐、套装效果组成的搭配。当前方案会随玩家的当前搭配实时变动。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>方案切换</>\n通过技能-非凡方案或装备-装备方案，将特定的搭配保存为方案后，即可通过方案切换，一键更改当前的搭配。战斗状态下无法进行方案切换。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>成组切换</>\n可将特定的非凡方案和装备方案打包为成组方案，切换成组方案时可以同时切换装备和非凡方案。可以为成组方案设置自动切换，前往特定场景时自动切为特定的成组方案。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Schemes</>\n Schemes are divided into Beyonder Schemes and Equipment Schemes. Beyonder Schemes consist of character skills, talents, and Sealed Artifacts, while Equipment Schemes consist of character equipment, gifts, and set effects. The current scheme updates in real-time based on the player's current setup.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Scheme Switching</>\n Through Skills-Beyonder Schemes or Equipment-Equipment Schemes, you can save specific setups as schemes and then switch them with one click. You cannot switch schemes while in combat.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Group Switching</>\n You can bundle specific Beyonder Schemes and Equipment Schemes into Group Schemes. When switching Group Schemes, you can change both equipment and Beyonder schemes simultaneously. You can set up automatic switching for Group Schemes to automatically change to a specific scheme when entering certain areas.",
